OL,3,GNEWSAGrenadier Guards awarded Freedom
OL,4,Aof Newmarket
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Grenadier Guards have been awarded
OL,7,Fthe Freedom of the Town of Newmarket at
OL,8,Fa special parade and event.
OL,10,FA march of the Nijmegen Company and
OL,11,FBand took place on the Suffolk town's
OL,12,FHigh Street, followed by a military
OL,13,Finspection and band concert at
OL,14,FTattersalls auctioneers.
OL,16,FPaul Cordle, a former Grenadier
OL,17,FOfficer, said the history of the
OL,18,Fregiment goes back 360 years, when the
OL,19,Froyal family was restored after the
OL,20,Frevolution in 1660, and Charles II came
OL,21,Fto the town as he "adored racing".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
