OL,3,GNEWSAGrenadier Guards awarded Freedom
OL,4,Aof Newmarket
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said it was "unusual for any town or
OL,7,Fcity to bestow their freedom on a
OL,8,Fregiment", and it had only happened in
OL,9,Fsix other places.
